{"id":"528477","name":"珍珠丸子","author":"伊悠悠","authorId":"230225","desc":"","cover":"images/528477/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"80g"},{"name":"木薯淀粉","amount":"20g"},{"name":"红糖","amount":"20g"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"50g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"克糯米粉，20克木薯淀粉，20克红糖，开水50克。","img":"images/528477/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/528477/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"看视频学习，用蒸锅架子用力接压面团，用勺子刮下，搓圆。","img":"images/528477/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"或者直接搓长条，分若干，搓圆。","img":"images/528477/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撒适量面粉，滚一滚，防沾。","img":"images/528477/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"水烧干，放入适量珍珠丸子煮至浮起。","img":"images/528477/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"捞出浸冷开水。","img":"images/528477/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入杯子里。","img":"images/528477/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入奶茶即可。","img":"images/528477/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}